00:18:22,360 --> 00:18:24,800
you do it for Netflix ratings.

443
00:18:24,800 --> 00:18:29,960
So on average, are Netflix ratings accurate for you?

444
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:31,640
And there, of course, if one individual

