8
00:40:25,880 --> 00:40:26,880
The answer is yes.

9
00:40:26,880 --> 00:40:39,840
There is another approach, very general one, and it's called search theory.

10
00:40:39,840 --> 00:40:42,880
Search theory has a few basic assumptions.

11
00:40:42,880 --> 00:40:45,920
First, we call the assumption of efforts.

12
00:40:45,920 --> 00:40:50,360
If you put more time and energy into searching for what you're looking for, you're more likely

13
00:40:50,360 --> 00:40:51,360
