230
01:09:39,760 --> 01:09:42,000
Something like that.

231
01:09:42,000 --> 01:09:45,400
Now, just as a matter of language,

232
01:09:45,400 --> 01:09:47,600
if you're indifferent between these two things,

233
01:09:47,600 --> 01:09:49,720
if you're indifferent between these two things,

234
01:09:49,720 --> 01:09:52,720
then you are risk neutral.

235
01:09:52,720 --> 01:09:55,120
If you're indifferent between these, you are risk neutral.

236
01:09:55,120 --> 01:09:57,200
If you prefer the sure thing to the gamble

237
01:09:57,200 --> 01:10:00,000
of the same expected value, you are, by definition,

238
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:01,800
