01:12:00,880 --> 01:12:02,400
That's like a third of the way along.

282
01:12:02,400 --> 01:12:07,600
So you'd rather have 1 third x plus 2 thirds y with certainty

283
01:12:07,600 --> 01:12:11,040
than have a 1 third chance x of x and a 2 third chance of y.

284
01:12:11,040 --> 01:12:14,960
And that is the part of being risk averse.

285
01:12:14,960 --> 01:12:16,320
And on the other hand, of course,

286
01:12:16,320 --> 01:12:17,760
if your utility function like this

