01:13:36,360 --> 01:13:38,560
Then you would actually have a negative risk premium.

317
01:13:38,560 --> 01:13:40,080
You say, hey, I'll pay something.

318
01:13:40,080 --> 01:13:41,520
I'll worsen the mean if I can just

