01:48:06,240 --> 01:48:08,680
and I'm indifferent between those two possibilities.

171
01:48:08,680 --> 01:48:10,480
So you could do it that way.

172
01:48:10,480 --> 01:48:14,880
With this work, you just have one risk neutral person in the entire company.

173
01:48:14,880 --> 01:48:17,440
Yeah. Again, so the only issue there is

174
01:48:17,440 --> 01:48:22,640
just if there is a minimum amount of wealth a person can have.

