01:48:38,760 --> 01:48:42,280
the variance is going to raise your expected payoff at that point.

181
01:48:44,000 --> 01:48:49,080
Now, another solution to role hazard,

182
01:48:49,080 --> 01:48:53,600
and one which Anglo-American law specifically persecutes,

183
01:48:53,600 --> 01:48:57,600
despite the pretty obvious case for it,

184
01:48:57,600 --> 01:49:00,560
is contractual punishment.

185
01:49:05,120 --> 01:49:08,520
So in general, there's a long tradition in

